WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.980
The Rose of Versailles

00:00:18.340 --> 00:00:19.990
Look, it's the city of Paris.

00:00:21.210 --> 00:00:22.770
It's been so long!

00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:24.080
''It's been so long''?

00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:26.240
We've only been away for 10 days.

00:00:27.380 --> 00:00:31.580
I feel like we saw a several years' worth
during these past 10 days though.

00:00:35.290 --> 00:00:36.850
<i>The whole country is dying!</i>

00:00:38.360 --> 00:00:42.990
<i>Don't you think the blame, for the suffering
of the people, all lies with the Queen?</i>

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:05.980
I wonder whatever happened to that girl?

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:14.920
I believe we saw her around here.

00:01:15.260 --> 00:01:17.960
She was blonde and had the eyes of an angel...

00:01:17.960 --> 00:01:19.900
I hope she finds her happiness.

00:01:21.670 --> 00:01:22.970
Come, let's go.

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:23.600
Yeah.

00:01:32.940 --> 00:01:34.710
You need to stay in bed.

00:01:35.350 --> 00:01:37.180
I'm all right, Rosalie.

00:01:37.180 --> 00:01:40.250
It's about time I get out of
bed and find some work,

00:01:40.250 --> 00:01:42.200
or my body will get stiff.

00:01:41.750 --> 00:01:44.550
Mom, don't worry about money.

00:01:45.390 --> 00:01:48.190
You just need to stay in bed and get lots of rest.

00:01:48.190 --> 00:01:50.960
I'm sorry for being such a burden.

00:01:51.330 --> 00:01:52.860
Oh, stop it, Mom.

00:01:52.860 --> 00:01:54.420
You're my mother. It's not a burden at all.

00:01:59.240 --> 00:02:01.440
Mom, don't worry.

00:02:01.440 --> 00:02:04.010
I'm sure I'll find work today.

00:02:04.010 --> 00:02:05.030
I'm sure of it!

